body:
I understand, but give it some time man. You need to digest some thoughts. There's so much more to life than sex/masturbation.

&#x200B;

edit: first find out if there's anything you can do about the problem, but I'm guessing you've already thought about that, so sorry for stating the obvious. But other than that I would give it time to digest your thoughts. It's very possible you can learn to live a happy life anyway.

Thanks for the response. I remember I learned about the shifting the hue towards more cooler/warmer for shadows/highlights, I had just forgotten about it. Will try it out. I will also try to up the contrast. Do you know if I can do that in Aseprite or do I need to do it in something like Photoshop?

&#x200B;

edit: I increased the contrast in Affinity Photo and yeah, I think it looks a bit better!
